    <string name="about_tagline">Pendamping lengkap, gratis, mbukak sumber kanggo saben Muslim - wektu sholat, Adzan, Quran, hadits, adhkar lan liya-liyane, ing basa sampeyan.</string>
    <string name="about_description_title">Babagan Muslim</string>
    <string name="about_description_body">Muslim minangka aplikasi Android gratis lan mbukak-sumber sing ngiringi sampeyan sedina muput: wektu sholat kanthi akurat kanthi astronomi karo Adzan, kompas kiblat sing tepat, Quran lengkap kanthi bacaan lan tafsir, perpustakaan hadits, sumber adhkar, tasbih elektronik, alat Ramadhan, kalkulator zakat, peta offline, lan liya-liyane - dirancang kanggo makarya kanthi offline kanthi privasi minangka standar.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">Sorotan</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">Kabeh sing dibutuhake Muslim ing siji aplikasi:</string>
    <string name="about_feature_prayer">Wektu shalat &amp; Adzan — kabeh cara ngitung, sekolah hukum, lan 18+ swara adzan</string>
    <string name="about_feature_quran">Quran Lengkap - Aksara Utsmani, 44 qari, tafsir, terjemahan, telusuran tembung &amp; frekuensi</string>
    <string name="about_feature_adhkar">Adhkar, tasbih, Ramadhan &amp; Zakat — kanthi pangeling lan gelembung ngambang</string>
    <string name="about_feature_offline">Offline-first - peta, Quran, hadits lan adhkar bisa digunakake tanpa internet</string>
    <string name="about_feature_privacy">Privasi kanthi gawan - ora ana iklan, ora ana pelacakan, data sampeyan tetep ana ing piranti sampeyan</string>
